        "message": "LU-21153 tests: wait for OST0 on all MDTs in sanity 27yb\n\nsanity 27yb restarts ost1 from an EXIT trap and does not wait for\nrecovery. In a DNE setup the other MDTs may still see OST0000 in\nREPLAY_WAIT when the next tests run, so the MDS statfs of OST0000\nreturns -EAGAIN, the OST is not counted as active, and sanity 27Ca\ncreates a \"-c -1\" file with one stripe fewer than OSTCOUNT.\n\nWait for recovery and for every MDT's import of the OST in the 27yb\nexit trap. Do the same in 27ya, which only waited for MDT0000.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 17c4a31275b3 (\"LU-20963 lod: use a reconnecting OST only when needed\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I3929142bec6362b3e66c3701026f2c232b072964\n"
      },
